  <prompt>Clear every typecheck error in src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/** so that FR-18's acceptance criterion — `npm run typecheck` is clean — becomes reachable, and so that errors introduced during Phases 1 through 3 are visible instead of buried in pre-existing noise. This directory also owns the three known broken barrel re-exports (`ViewType` and `SaveOptions`). Fix the types properly: this task is type-level only and must not change what the pane does at runtime.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. TypeScript strict-mode remediation (exactOptionalPropertyTypes, noUncheckedIndexedAccess, noUnusedLocals/Parameters) in a React 19 plus Fluent UI v9 Office add-in. You are correcting types, not refactoring components. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>`npm run typecheck` in src/client/office-addins reports zero errors for every file under shared/taskpane/**; the three known barrel defects are resolved correctly rather than papered over; `npm run build` and `npm test` are green; the error counts in the two directories this task does NOT own are unchanged from the task 001 baseline; and the fix patterns used are recorded in projects/spaarkeai-word-add-in-r1/notes/ for tasks 007 and 008 to follow.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>FR-18 (spec.md line 92) requires clearing the pre-existing typecheck debt in src/client/office-addins first, so new errors are visible during feature work. Four strict options in src/client/office-addins/tsconfig.json drive the debt: `noUnusedLocals` (line 16), `noUnusedParameters` (line 17), `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` (line 20) and `exactOptionalPropertyTypes` (line 21). plan.md splits the clearance three ways by directory; this task owns the largest share. Two concrete defects are already confirmed in this directory and are not merely strictness noise: src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/index.ts line 3 re-exports `ViewType` from `./App`, and App.tsx does not export it; the same file's line 18 re-exports `SaveOptions` from `./components/views/SaveView`, and SaveView.tsx does not export it; and src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/components/views/index.ts line 2 repeats the same broken `SaveOptions` re-export. These are real broken public surface, not formatting. This directory is where every Phase 1 through 3 pane feature lands (tabs, views, cards, profile, Find, To Do, Send Email), which is why it is cleared before that work rather than after.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/index.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/components/views/index.ts</file>
